                Every card below renders an actual Phui component (live demo) and its usage
                snippet. Components are single Vue 3 modules served by the framework asset
                pipeline and imported <strong>only if this page lists them</strong>.
            </p>
            <p class="text-body-secondary mb-3" style="max-width: 75ch;">
                <strong>No whitelist, no import:</strong> components are auto-discovered from the template and imported into one self-sufficient module - minted per page.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Form Controls -->
        <section id="forms" class="mb-5">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-semibold mb-3">Form Controls</h2>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-12 col-xl-6">
                    <div class="card p-3 h-100">
                        <h5 class="mb-1" code-title="PhButton"><code>&lt;ph-button&gt;</code></h5>
